B008 Do not perform function call `NotFrozen` in argument defaults; instead, perform the call within the function, or read the default from a module-level singleton variable
  --> B008_frozen_dataclass.py:89:11
   |
88 | # Errors
89 | def f(foo=NotFrozen()): ...
   |           ^^^^^^^^^^^

B008 Do not perform function call `ExplicitlyNotFrozen` in argument defaults; instead, perform the call within the function, or read the default from a module-level singleton variable
  --> B008_frozen_dataclass.py:92:11
   |
92 | def f(foo=ExplicitlyNotFrozen()): ...
   |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

