B008 Do not perform function call `len` in argument defaults; instead, perform the call within the function, or read the default from a module-level singleton variable
  --> B008_frozen_dataclass.py:99:27
   |
98 | # Calls nested inside a frozen dataclass instantiation are still checked.
99 | def f(foo=Frozen(val=bool(len([])))): ...
   |                           ^^^^^^^
